Package: slopcar
Version: {version}
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: {architecture}
Maintainer: Lev Gorodetskii <slopworld@drsr.io>
Depends: {shared_libraries}, docker.io | docker-ce-cli
Homepage: https://github.com/droserasprout/slopworld
Description: Host launcher for the SlopWorld Linux sidecar
 Manages the container, workspace and credential mounts, and persistent state.
 Requires access to a running local Docker engine. Does not install the native
 SlopWorld daemon, game mod, or agent CLIs.
